          "name": "语言与格式规则",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "C# 使用 Text.Get / Text.Format，XAML 使用 loc:Loc。完整句模板与 {0} 参数在两种语言一致；缺译与不支持语言均回退英文。UI 跟随 Windows 显示语言或已有手动选择，应用启动时先确定语言。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Xnw4v",
          "name": "模块与标识规则",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Redis 协议 / SDK 留在独立 provider 模块，Redis 内容页留在独立 UI 模块，公共 UI 不引用协议实现。偏好仍由 ILanguagePreferenceStore 写入 SQLite app_setting；业务判断使用稳定 ID / 枚举，主机、凭据、协议值和用户名称不翻译。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
